Fixed: the function template name was resolved without a target, from
the first complete specialization of os in the symbol table, so one of
the two insertions called operator<<(bool).  resolve_overload_set_operand
now deduces it from the member operator<< functions taking a pointer to
function ([temp.deduct.funcaddr]/1).
